<h1>Welcome to Template Demo</h1>
<p>This is a simple web application demonstrating dynamic template rendering.</p>

<h2>Page Rendering</h2>
<p>Use the <a href="/page">/page</a> endpoint to render dynamic pages.</p>
<p>Parameters:</p>
<ul>
    <li><code>title</code> - Page title</li>
    <li><code>content</code> - Page content</li>
    <li><code>layout</code> - Layout template to use</li>
</ul>

<h2>Preview</h2>
<p>Use the <a href="/preview">/preview</a> endpoint to preview templates.</p>
